Manual review corrections for this page's first pass, all local
typographic and mathematical-notation defects rather than upstream
OpenStax content issues:

- "What is the value of $\text{``}c\text{''}$" wrapped literal quotation
  marks inside math mode around the variable name; changed to
  "``$c$''" with the quotes as ordinary text and only the variable
  itself in math mode.
- Three iterated-map exercises used a stray empty group before a
  superscript, `x_{n}{}^{2}` / `x_{n}{}^{3}`, a converter artifact with
  no effect other than obscuring the source; simplified to `x_{n}^{2}`
  / `x_{n}^{3}`.
- "$x^{3}+{(x+1)}^{3}=10^{3}$" wrapped an already-parenthesized term in
  a redundant brace group; removed the extra braces.
- "$\tan(x)$ on $x=(\frac{\pi}{2},\frac{3\pi}{2})$" asserted $x$ equals
  an interval rather than ranging over it; changed to
  "$x\in(\frac{\pi}{2},\frac{3\pi}{2})$", matching this file's own
  "choose $x_{0}\in(-\frac{\pi}{2},\frac{\pi}{2})$" a few exercises
  earlier.

